# The game adapter scenario (sampcov.pwn commands, one per line; `sleep|S` waits, `shot|NAME` takes a screenshot):
# vehicle colours, paintjob, components, damage, params, a trailer, an explosion, camera moves, widescreen,
# gravity, the jetpack, the player's velocity and a menu. Run after the spawn by samp-rs-ab.sh (CMDS=...) on the DLL
# client and by mod-join.sh (CMDS=...) on the samp mod. Vehicle ids: the cars mod-join.sh adds are removed first, so
# the ones created here are 1..5 on both clients.
